===Etymology 1===
{{unk|es}}, maybe related to {{cog|fr|gai}}, {{cog|it|gaio}}, {{cog|en|gay}}, of {{der|es|gem|-}} origin, or from {{bor|es|ar|كُوَيِّس||t=good}}.

